          <attvalue for="topology_description" value="Figure 1: Overview of our DARS scaling method. DARS processes issue-related information and generates multiple&#xA;patches using the Expansion mechanism. These patches are then evaluated by our Reviewer LLM, which assigns&#xA;scores based on predefined Score Rubrics, ultimately selecting the best patch for output."/>
